0..75 Comment "// An attribute block of two entries before a data block, a signature and a"
76..148 Comment "// function: each block is read whole, so the unknown `note` refuses its"
149..223 Comment "// declaration whatever it precedes. An inner block `@![ … ]` can open a"
224..301 Comment "// module\'s or a theory\'s body. It then decorates that module or theory, as a"
302..326 Comment "// block before it does."
